text = "Guillermo based off and voiced by ToxicTinfoil on YT

Rim designed by HastyPasty on YT

Lots of textures from AmbientCG https://ambientcg.com/ (cool website)
Some models are from various websites listed here:
Red guy cosmetic from Dont Hug Me I'm Scared S2EP6
Red Car by J-Toastie [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Water Cooler by J-Toastie [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Glasses by iPoly3D
Drone by Silly Fear [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
skull003 by Jake K-H [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Air conditioner by Poly by Google [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Elevator by Poly by Google [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Blimp by Poly by Google [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Pew Pew by Damon Pidhajecky [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Meme Man by DanFourts via Gmod Workshop
Maxwell (dingus) by alwayshasbean via Gmod Workshop
Blackboard by jeremy [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Light Chandelier by Quaternius
Chair by Quaternius
Antenna by Quaternius
Solar Panel by Quaternius
Table by Darwin Yamamoto [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Casette Player by Jason Toff [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Orange Chaise Lounge Chair by S. Paul Michael [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Fountain by Poly by Google [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Flat Screen TV by Alex Safayan [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Drone by NateGazzard [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza
Basketball court by Poly by Google [CC-BY] via Poly Pizza

Other credits:
lil whisker's music by harvo on YT
maxwell theme by Weebl's Stuff on YT
social credit theme by Blaxy Girls

daryll billboad by Ted Nivison on YT"
